# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in a real value.
#
# Gates POST /api/game-icon/<game-id> (serve.ts) — the one mutating route on
# this otherwise-static app. Unset or empty means uploads are refused
# entirely (fails closed), not "anyone may write." See CLAUDE.md § Game icons
# for the endpoint and the trade-off of running it on a hostname with no
# other access gate in front.
ICON_UPLOAD_PASSWORD=
